{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 3830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 2250, "text": "Hey, Miss Sullivan, you want to hear\nyour horoscope?"}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 7050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 4090, "text": "Yeah, what does it say? It says you're\ngoing to sleep with a tall, dark,"}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 10690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 7090, "text": "handsome prosecuting attorney at 9 .15."}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 15050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 12610, "text": "It says don't let your passion sweep you\nawake."}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 16670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 15630, "text": "I was paraphrasing."}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 22670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 19070, "text": "You know, that sounds more like Roz's\nhoroscope, because she's..."}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 27810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 22670, "text": "She's what, Moe?"}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 29490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 28490, "text": "Nothing."}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 32439, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 31440, "text": "Nothing at all."}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 35060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 32680, "text": "Just go on about your normal daily\nbusiness."}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 38580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 36700, "text": "Oh, come on, Bull. What about Roz?"}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 41560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 39140, "text": "She doesn't want you to get around, so\nyou gotta promise to keep it a secret."}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 44460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 41740, "text": "Sure. Cross your heart and hope that\nI... Yes."}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 45760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 44700, "text": "Stick a needle in your eye?"}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 49020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 47020, "text": "Yes. Crime your face in a blender?"}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 51500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 50500, "text": "Yes!"}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 55620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 53340, "text": "Roz has a boyfriend."}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 58640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 57640, "text": "Get out!"}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 63270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 61610, "text": "Haven't you noticed how cheerful she's\nbeen lately?"}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 65710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 63550, "text": "Thought there was just an ammo sale at\nShoot and Save."}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 70370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 68810, "text": "She's been seeing him for about a month."}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 72390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 70670, "text": "She calls him four or five times every\nday."}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 74870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 72930, "text": "Gee, sounds like it could be the big L."}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 77070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 76070, "text": "Lutter?"}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 81250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 80190, "text": "Look, there she is."}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 86310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 82410, "text": "The regular five o 'clock phone call to\nher kissy -uggy snuggles."}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 89370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 88370, "text": "Hello, DeWayne."}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 91570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 89930, "text": "I just wanted to tell you something."}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 95730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 92230, "text": "I don't ever want to see your ugly face\nagain unless it has an accent."}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 152230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 149770, "text": "Uh, next case, sir. People versus Mr."}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 153470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 152470, "text": "Richard Jorgensen."}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 162290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 159030, "text": "Hmm. What's wrong with this picture?"}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 168710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 163690, "text": "This is the defendant, Rhonda, formerly\nRichard Jorgensen, charged with indecent"}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 172230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 168710, "text": "exposure. Since the arrest, the\ndefendant had his name changed."}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 174410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 173210, "text": "Among other things."}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 178890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 176750, "text": "I see. So, what have we got?"}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 181040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 179440, "text": "Not as much as we used to."}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 192120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 188400, "text": "Your Honor, in light of the operation, I\nmove for dismissal."}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 193480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 192420, "text": "On what grounds?"}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 195360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 194360, "text": "Lack of evidence."}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 200300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 199180, "text": "Okay, Mr."}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 204020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 200600, "text": "and Ms. Jorgensen, I'm going to drop the\nindecent exposure charge as long as you"}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 205940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 204020, "text": "promise that you'll never again..."}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 210430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 209010, "text": "Right. Have a nice day."}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 215190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 212870, "text": "Well, so much for that little slice of\nlife."}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 218590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 216730, "text": "Roz, will you bring in the next\ndefendant, please?"}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 220070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 218910, "text": "Don't you snap at me!"}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 224390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 221450, "text": "Is it just me, or is Roz not a happy\ncamper?"}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 227130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 225550, "text": "I hate to see you so upset."}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 231390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 227650, "text": "Well, it's obvious what the problem is.\nHer boyfriend is gone, and now her needs"}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 233530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 231390, "text": "are tragically unfulfilled."}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 239160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 235560, "text": "You know how cranky women can get when\nthey don't get sex on a regular basis?"}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 243120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 241600, "text": "Oh, cram it, you pig."}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 250460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 249460, "text": "Arrest my case."}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 262520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 259560, "text": "I think that we should at least talk to\nRoz. Help her get things off her chest."}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 265620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 262840, "text": "No, I don't think Roz is really the\nheartfelt discussion type."}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 268400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 266000, "text": "Oh, I know she can be a little moody at\ntimes."}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 271500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 269780, "text": "I said stand up!"}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 277520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 275620, "text": "Okay, she can be downright testy."}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 281220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 277980, "text": "But she's been with us for nearly two\nyears and none of us even knows her."}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 284280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 281680, "text": "I think Roz really needs someone to talk\nto."}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 286840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 285400, "text": "And I'm going to be that someone."}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 291070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 287470, "text": "Miss Sullivan, I've had some experience\nin this. Now, believe me, it's not a"}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 293970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 291070, "text": "good idea to butt into someone else's\npersonal problems."}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 297490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 294730, "text": "Sir, I'm sure glad you called me last\nnight about the vasectomy."}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 304810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 302130, "text": "And if I go ahead with it, I will have a\ndoctor do it."}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 314650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 310870, "text": "Now, that wasn't butting in. The guy\nwanted to borrow my weed whacker."}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 324100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 323080, "text": "to open up to someone."}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 325480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 324480, "text": "Roz!"}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 329940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 328940, "text": "Maybe later."}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 337340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 333800, "text": "Well, I'm going to find the defendant\nguilty of assault and battery and Mr."}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 341020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 337540, "text": "Gunther, I'm going to give you two days\nin the slammer because you've got to"}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 344680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 341020, "text": "learn that this is not funny no matter\nwhat you think of the man's musical"}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 345680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 344680, "text": "talent."}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 370310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 367850, "text": "You know, you'd really feel better if\nyou talked about it."}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 372830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 371190, "text": "Look, Christine, I like you."}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 374710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 373130, "text": "That's why you got a warning shot."}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 378810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 376550, "text": "It couldn't hurt to talk about it for a\nminute."}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 380830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 379510, "text": "Please? Please?"}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 383270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 382270, "text": "All right, talk."}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 389130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 384990, "text": "Roz, look, we are not that different. I\nknow what it's like to be hurt by a man."}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 393250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 389610, "text": "Why, I even had a boyfriend dump me in\nthe middle of the prom."}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 396350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 394230, "text": "Mine tried to run me over with his\nBuick."}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 407520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 403120, "text": "Listen, Christine, it's nothing\npersonal. I just can't stand being"}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 412460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 410320, "text": "That's because you don't know me."}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 415880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 413480, "text": "We have to learn about each other."}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 417840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 416280, "text": "Can't I just send you my resume?"}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 420420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 418880, "text": "I mean one -to -one."}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 423060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 420720, "text": "Francis, come on. What do you usually do\nafter work?"}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 424480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 423480, "text": "Break horses."}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 430660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 425920, "text": "Oh, come on. Isn't there someplace you\nlike to go to unwind? A tavern? A"}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 431740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 430740, "text": "A boite?"}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 434620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 432460, "text": "Well, there's Monty's. Oh, there you\nsee?"}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 435920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 434840, "text": "That sounds like fun. Let's go."}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 439740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 436740, "text": "I'm not so sure it's your kind of what."}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 443600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 441820, "text": "Oh, come on, Roz. It'll be keen."}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 445600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 444120, "text": "Please, please, please."}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 448660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 446680, "text": "You're going to pester me till I die,\naren't you?"}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 451060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 450060, "text": "Yes."}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 454180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 451520, "text": "Good. Then when I kill you, it'll be\nself -defense."}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 464700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 462120, "text": "Glad you changed your mind. This is\ngoing to be spiffy."}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 467820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 466820, "text": "Wow."}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 470900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 468800, "text": "Evening, Roz. I've saved you your usual\ntable."}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 472960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 471100, "text": "Hey, yo, clear this table off for Roz\nand her friends."}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 477360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 474400, "text": "Thank you."}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 482600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 479460, "text": "Well, this isn't too bad."}
