{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 489400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 488120, "text": "So, how'd you find this place?"}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 490720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 489720, "text": "I live up there."}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 499200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 497840, "text": "We're fresh out of poop."}
