{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 505140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 504060, "text": "What, your usual run?"}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 506760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 505440, "text": "Yeah, hideaway special."}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 508200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 507040, "text": "I'll have one of those, too."}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 511380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 509520, "text": "So, here we are together."}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 519059, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 513860, "text": "At last, we have a chance to really get\nto know each other, to really learn what"}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 523000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 519059, "text": "makes each other tick, to see inside\neach other's souls."}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 525660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 524039, "text": "Outside? Are you blind?"}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 528630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 527630, "text": "Here's your drink, lady."}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 529810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 528810, "text": "Ah, wow."}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 532190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 530950, "text": "Uh, could I have a straw?"}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 534550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 533550, "text": "Sure."}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 539370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 538370, "text": "There you go."}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 543390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 541950, "text": "I think he likes you."}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 545550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 544550, "text": "Yeah, well."}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 549550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 546150, "text": "Um, I think, uh, toast is in order."}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 553810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 551910, "text": "Here's to good friend."}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 558120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 556520, "text": "Tonight is kind of special."}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 561540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 560180, "text": "Shut up."}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 564040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 563040, "text": "Woo!"}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 568900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 567760, "text": "That is really something."}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 573960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 569940, "text": "Roz, um, what is that on the side of my\nglass?"}
