{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 578700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 575880, "text": "No, the thing opening up the umbrella."}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 591500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 589320, "text": "They just take a sip, lay eggs, and move\non."}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 596640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 594580, "text": "Okay, folks, it's showtime."}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 599240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 597200, "text": "I didn't know there was live\nentertainment."}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 601940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 599580, "text": "This isn't just any old what."}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 607820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 603720, "text": "Direct from a smash appearance at\nRocco's Blunt Instrument Lounge."}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 611140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 608260, "text": "The Flamingo stylings of the one."}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 612560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 611440, "text": "The only."}
