{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 630080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 628200, "text": "In fact, he's not much of a dancer."}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 639180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 637640, "text": "Maybe I'm being too critical."}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 645220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 643280, "text": "What do you think of the captainette\nnow?"}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 655670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 653290, "text": "that was Redwood Wally and his little\nstump."}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 663990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 662070, "text": "Me, sir? How'd you do that?"}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 666670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 664230, "text": "Let's just say I mastered the\npossibility."}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 674430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 668130, "text": "And now, let's have a big Monty's\nwelcome for Sinbad the"}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 675950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 674430, "text": "Snake Jarman!"}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 698280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 694220, "text": "into, she shouldn't be associating with\nthese depraved women whipping themselves"}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 699920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 698280, "text": "into a frenzy of lust."}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 702640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 700640, "text": "I'll take out as many as I can, sir."}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 707140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 706140, "text": "Isn't that a Christine?"}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 711280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 707780, "text": "No. Of course I could see a lot better\nif it wasn't for that crazy bimbo"}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 712280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 711280, "text": "on the table."}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 729560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 728240, "text": "Yeah, where'd she learn to play the\nflute?"}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 744940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 743940, "text": "Boy,"}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 747960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 746520, "text": "I never thought I'd live to see that."}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 750500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 749000, "text": "It's just like all my dreams."}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 753400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 751280, "text": "Except, of course, she's not wearing the\ncatcher's mask."}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 762140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 757960, "text": "I mean, it's Christine's business if she\nwants to jump rope with a string of"}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 763140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 762140, "text": "jock straps."}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 764980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 763980, "text": "You out!"}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 767140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 765360, "text": "No man to left for 11 p .m."}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 771880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 767640, "text": "Do you know who you're talking to? This\nis Judge Harold T. Stone."}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 777360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 772920, "text": "He's right. And these guys are my court\nofficers."}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 786000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 780780, "text": "We're on a fact -finding habeas corpus.\nWe're investigating modus operandi."}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 791950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 787850, "text": "Well, I'm very sorry, Judge. I cooperate\nfully with the law here. Right, I'll"}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 793410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 791950, "text": "make note of that in your ipso facto."}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 794990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 793990, "text": "Gee, thanks."}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 797330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 795510, "text": "Feel free to investigate anything."}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 800530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 798470, "text": "This is going to take some intensive\nprobing."}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 808490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 804430, "text": "Wow, look at this. You and that uniform."}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 809690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 808690, "text": "I love it."}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 812470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 811350, "text": "You like to dance?"}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 815850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 814270, "text": "Can we just leave it at a handshake?"}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 839250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 838190, "text": "in there without a machete."}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 842310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 840590, "text": "Okay, then I'll do it on my own."}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 844210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 843210, "text": "Excuse me, ladies."}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 845750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 844230, "text": "Hi, excuse me. Oh, hey."}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 847150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 845970, "text": "Oh, bingo."}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 850450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 848690, "text": "Excuse me. Excuse me."}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 852870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 851510, "text": "Gotcha, you pervert."}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 854690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 853110, "text": "No, no, I wasn't doing nothing, I\npromise."}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 857230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 855010, "text": "Well, why not, cutie pie?"}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 863670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 857610, "text": "Lady, I... You"}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 866010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 863670, "text": "drained my finances."}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 883540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 882540, "text": "I wasn't surprised."}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 884720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 883720, "text": "Where'd you come from?"}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 886880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 885500, "text": "The mouth of the Amazon."}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 926620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 925580, "text": "You like that guy dancing up there?"}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 929440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 927940, "text": "Tell me one good thing about him."}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 931220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 930220, "text": "He's not you."}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 935920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 933400, "text": "Yeah, yeah, yeah. What has he got that I\nhaven't got?"}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 958430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 956810, "text": "a delicate, gentle woman like yourself."}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 961190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 960190, "text": "Once,"}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 966410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 964430, "text": "twice, three times a lady."}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 970470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 968410, "text": "Sir, sir, can we get the hell out of\nhere now?"}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 971750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 970730, "text": "Everything's under control."}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 993280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 989859, "text": "Now. Oh, you are such a fanny."}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 1001100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 997240, "text": "Well, that did it. You left me no\nchoice. I'm going to carry you out of"}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 1003940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1001820, "text": "So, two -timing me, huh?"}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 1005200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1004200, "text": "Uh, no, actually."}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 1006700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1005240, "text": "Hey, who let in the hippo?"}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 1010860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1007240, "text": "You left me for some cheesy tramp with a\npadded bra."}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 1013320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1012320, "text": "Padded?"}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 1016140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1014160, "text": "Honey, these are factory original."}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 1028380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1024739, "text": "Actress Mouseketeer, let's see what\nyou're made of. Oh, you want to get"}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 1029520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1028520, "text": "huh?"}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 1054280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1053260, "text": "decency to oil up."}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 1062340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1059140, "text": "$460, $480, $500."}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 1064200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1062720, "text": "My God, where did you get all that\nmoney?"}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 1065520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1064520, "text": "At Monty's."}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 1067900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1065780, "text": "Women kept stuffing 20s down my pants."}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 1071260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1070040, "text": "That's disgusting."}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 1074400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1072520, "text": "I only got 10s."}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 1078400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1076380, "text": "Wait a minute, wait a minute, wait."}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 1103220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1100880, "text": "Sorry about your eye, sir. I guess I got\ncarried away."}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 1106000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1104060, "text": "Actually, he's the one who got carried\naway."}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 1108000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1107000, "text": "What was that?"}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 1111660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1108340, "text": "Sir, I'm sorry. I didn't think a little\nthing like me could knock a man silly."}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 1118220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1112220, "text": "Hey, I wasn't knocked silly. I was\nsimply expressing my shock at your"}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 1125080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1121540, "text": "Miss Sullivan, I warned you about\nsticking your nose into other people's"}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 1127360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1125080, "text": "business, but did you listen to me? No."}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 1133560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1128740, "text": "Not that I didn't enjoy it. having Big\nMaggie floss my teeth with her tongue."}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 1140600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1136680, "text": "None of this ever would have happened if\ncertain people didn't stick their noses"}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 1143960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1140600, "text": "into other people's business where they\ndidn't belong in the first place."}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 1148620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1144520, "text": "You're absolutely right, sir. You see,\nRoz agrees with me. I was talking about"}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 1149620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1148620, "text": "you."}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 1152860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1150360, "text": "What? You were the one butting in."}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 1156020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1153340, "text": "If you hadn't come down there, none of\nthis would have happened."}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 1160480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1157000, "text": "I was just trying to keep her from\nbothering you. Who says I wanted you to?"}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 1162420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1160900, "text": "I was on my own time."}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 1167080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1162640, "text": "If I want to go out with a friend, then\nthat's my business."}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 1168540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1167540, "text": "I'm not finished."}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 1169900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1168860, "text": "Yes, please go on."}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 1171140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1170140, "text": "Thank you."}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 1174280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1172860, "text": "I have nothing more to say."}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 1178820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1177020, "text": "Except we forgive you."}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 1183960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1181740, "text": "Fine, as long as I've made myself clear."}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 1190180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1185960, "text": "Now, if you'll excuse me, I'm going to\ngo slap a butt steak on my face."}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 1194820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1193440, "text": "Boy, he sure seems mad."}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 1197600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1195400, "text": "Guess we shouldn't have auctioned off\nhis underpants."}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 1205620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1200640, "text": "Um, Ron, did you mean it when you called\nme a friend?"}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 1207380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1206380, "text": "Nope."}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 1212640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1208820, "text": "Oh, well, see you later."}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 1215100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1214100, "text": "Christine."}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 1218640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1216940, "text": "There's a reason why you're not my\nfriend."}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 1222320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1220240, "text": "People like me don't have friends."}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 1225620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1223680, "text": "What do you mean, people like you?"}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 1232460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1226440, "text": "People who play nude war games and\nroller skate hanging on the motorcycle"}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 1236820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1232460, "text": "and are shy."}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 1240400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1238680, "text": "You? Shy?"}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 1244020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1241040, "text": "The one who said to the Pope, hey, take\noff that pointy..."}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 1250020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1246540, "text": "When I pay five bucks to see Hercules\nunchained, I don't want anything"}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 1251020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1250020, "text": "the screen."}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 1263500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1256520, "text": "I'm uncomfortable around people because\nI'm afraid that if they get to know"}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 1264720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1263500, "text": "me, they won't like me."}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 1272420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1265980, "text": "Oh, Roz, that's silly. You're very\nlikable when you're not shooting at"}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 1275160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1273800, "text": "It's a defense mechanism."}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 1279940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1278160, "text": "Well, it didn't work with me."}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 1283720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1280460, "text": "And I think that's because deep down you\nwant a friend."}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 1289380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1285280, "text": "Guess if I have to have a friend, it\nought to be somebody who can make Big"}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 1290560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1289380, "text": "Maggie suck soda."}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 1297220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1292360, "text": "Well, that wasn't really me. That was\nthose hideaway specials. What's in those"}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 1298220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1297220, "text": "things anyway?"}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 1300880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1298900, "text": "Pineapple juice, soda water, and ice."}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 1306219, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1305340, "text": "That's it?"}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 1307220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1306220, "text": "That's it."}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 1310740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1307980, "text": "There's no booze at all in those things?"}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 1312580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1311500, "text": "Not a drop."}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 1321880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1315420, "text": "So, then, I did all those crazy things\nbecause deep"}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 1326140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1321880, "text": "down I'm more like you appear to be than\nyou are."}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 1327980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1326980, "text": "Live with that."}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 1333780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1331360, "text": "Well, then, there's a chance we can be\nfriends."}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 1336220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1334580, "text": "Heck, we can be bosom buddies."}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 1339260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1337480, "text": "With the two of us, that's saying quite\na bit."}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 1344400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1341620, "text": "Listen, uh, you got any plans for\ntomorrow night?"}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 1346880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1345700, "text": "Tomorrow night? No."}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 1350000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1347400, "text": "You ever see tag team mud wrestling on\ncable TV?"}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 1354260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1351460, "text": "Oh, Ross, I really, I don't like to\nwatch those things."}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 1356500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1354680, "text": "Who said anything about watching?"}
